      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 模型下载 / Model download\n\n打开工作流后，ComfyUI 会提示缺少的权重。点击 Download 下载当前模型。\nComfyUI shows any missing weights when you open the workflow. Click Download for the selected model.\n\nDesktop 会处理下载和保存。使用 Portable 或浏览器时，请按下面的路径保存，然后刷新模型列表。\nDesktop handles the download. In Portable or a browser, save the file here, then refresh the model list:\n\n`ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/PixText-MeanFlow.safetensors`\n\n如果浏览器把文件保存成 `model.safetensors`，请改成上面的文件名。连接远程 ComfyUI 时，文件要放在服务器上。\nRename the file if your browser uses its original name. For remote ComfyUI, put it on the server.\n\n配置和字体随节点提供，不用另下。原来的完整模型包也能继续使用。\nConfiguration and fonts come with the nodes. Existing complete model packages still work.\n\n[下载当前权重 / Download selected weights](https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/PixText/resolve/main/models/PixText-MeanFlow/model.safetensors) · [全部模型 / All models](https://huggingface.co/ATH-MaaS/PixText)"
      ],
      "color": "#28443f",
      "bgcolor": "#18262d"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "OCR model downloads",
      "pos": [
        940,
        -380
      ],
      "size": [
        940,
        470
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# OCR 模型下载 / OCR model downloads\n\n先下载下面三个文件，放到运行 ComfyUI 的电脑上。\nDownload these three files to the computer running ComfyUI.\n\n1. [CRAFT 检测模型 / Detection model (ZIP)](https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR/releases/download/pre-v1.1.6/craft_mlt_25k.zip)\n   解压 ZIP，取出 craft_mlt_25k.pth。Extract the ZIP and keep craft_mlt_25k.pth.\n   保存目录 / Save in: `ComfyUI/models/pixtext_ocr/`\n2. [PP-OCRv6 识别权重 / Recognition weights](https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/resolve/50c7eacafc52fa7bcf4194e8cd08e46f8558504b/inference.onnx?download=true)\n3. [PP-OCRv6 字典配置 / Dictionary configuration](https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/resolve/50c7eacafc52fa7bcf4194e8cd08e46f8558504b/inference.yml?download=true)\n\n后两个文件放在同一目录。Save both PP-OCRv6 files in:\n`ComfyUI/models/pixtext_ocr/PP-OCRv6_medium_rec_onnx/`\n\n在 PixText 节点目录中，用运行 ComfyUI 的 Python 安装依赖，完成后重启。\nFrom the PixText node folder, install dependencies with ComfyUI's Python, then restart:\n`python -m pip install -r requirements-ocr.txt`\n\n文件放好后点击 Run，检查识别出的框，再修改目标文字。\nOnce the files are in place, click Run, review the boxes and enter your corrections."
      ],
      "color": "#35465a",
      "bgcolor": "#18262d"
    }
